---
// About page hero section
---

<section id="about-hero" class="relative bg-dark-background py-20 lg:py-28 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0">
    <img
      src="https://pagesmith-cdn.com/84515c4a/images/0a1152d2f01a73d7d22b6f82d01f1d29-1536.webp"
      alt="Michelle Turpin P.C. law firm"
      class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-40"
      loading="eager"
    />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-black/70 via-black/60 to-black/70"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center">
    <p class="text-[#C1272D] text-[14px] lg:text-[16px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-bold mb-4">About Our Firm</p>
    <h1 class="text-[44px] lg:text-[60px] font-bold text-white font-serif leading-[1.1] mb-6">
      Utah Tax Attorneys Fighting for Your Rights Since 1989
    </h1>
    <p class="text-[18px] lg:text-[22px] text-gray-200 italic max-w-[850px] mx-auto leading-relaxed">
      We are a full-service tax law firm with more than 100 years of cumulative experience helping individuals and businesses deal with all of their tax issues. We fight the IRS to achieve the best possible outcome for you.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
